AltoRewardsOracle::startTwapPeriod()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── given oracle is already initiated
    │   └── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is not zero
    │       └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleAlreadyStartedTwapPeriod
    └── given oracle is not initiated
        ├── when initialPrice is zero
        │   └── it should revert with AltoRewardsOracleInvalidInput
        ├── when lastPriceUpdateTimestamp is zero
        │   ├── it should set lastPriceUpdateTimestamp to current block timestamp
        │   ├── it should set cachedPrice to provided initial price
        │   └── it should emit PriceUpdated event with timestamp, cachedPrice, and oldPrice of 0
        └── when testing with different price values (1, normal, max)
            ├── it should handle minimum non-zero price correctly
            ├── it should handle normal price correctly
            └── it should handle maximum uint256 price correctly